OL,3,APlaid's Rhun ap Iorwerth makes first
OL,4,Aparty conference speech since winning
OL,5,ASenedd election
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,8,Faddresses his party's autumn conference
OL,9,Fon Friday afternoon
OL,11,FIt's the first conference the party has
OL,12,Fheld since it won May's Senedd election
OL,14,FThe event comes as Plaid's minority
OL,15,Fgovernment tries to find an opposition
OL,16,Fparty that will agree its budget plans
OL,18,FReform, Labour and the Tories have all
OL,19,Fcriticised Rhun ap Iorwerth's agreement
OL,20,Fwith the SNP and Sinn Fein, which
OL,21,Fdeclared Westminster's time was coming
OL,22,Fto an end
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
